// p50/p99 request latency by endpoint, last 1 hour.
// Table: requests - populated by the Azure Monitor OpenTelemetry exporter from
// ASP.NET Core's server-kind Activities (OpenTelemetry.Instrumentation.AspNetCore,
// wired in Observability/TelemetryExtensions.cs). operation_Name is the route
// template (e.g. "POST /api/quotes/{id}"), not the raw URL - so /api/quotes/17 and
// /api/quotes/42 aggregate together instead of each getting their own row.
requests
| where timestamp > ago(1h)
| summarize
    requestCount = count(),
    failedCount = countif(success == false),
    p50Ms = percentile(duration, 50),
    p90Ms = percentile(duration, 90),
    p99Ms = percentile(duration, 99)
    by operation_Name
| extend errorRatePercent = round(100.0 * failedCount / requestCount, 2)
| order by p99Ms desc
